Warhammer: End Times Vermintide is a wonderfull 4 player co-op game, I personally love Warhammer themed games, but this one shines above most of them.
Most impressive elements of the game are:
- Aesthetics (The dark and scary End Times world truly feels like it is your last stand);
- Characters (5 amazing characters, which are not only distingiushable graphically but also have their own personality);
- Cool (but sometimes repetetive) missions;
- DLC can be accesed through a friend who bought the DLC, so you can experience it before buying;
Before anyone tries to grab this game, I would like to inform that there is somewhat steep hill to learn the tricks and basics of this game (considering the amount and diffrent stats of loot), so starting may be though.
Finding cooperative players was easier than expected, which is a big plus.
In the end, for me this game became BEST 4-Player Co-op game, even better then L4D2 (but that's only my opinion).

